DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\nMEETUP POINT: 300 kingston Rd
 \, Pickering\nThis is a quick ..2.5..hour hike up and down focusing on bui
 lding cardio and calf muscles.\nSame place every Saturday and same hills w
 here we increase the number of repetitions each week.\nThis is your time t
 o bring it on!\nJust for fun you could bring a loaded backpack!
