BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: These Boots Are Made for Hiking
UID:event_315011597@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260601T045308Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260607T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260607T160000
SUMMARY:Hike\, History and Falls!
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\nMeetup location: Ancaster Mil
 l Car Park\\. \\(GPS Coordinates: \\[43\\.23237119351187\\\, \\-79\\]\\(te
 l:43\\.23237119351187\\\, \\-79\\)\\.[97520656038239](tel:97520656038239))
 \n\nThe entrance to the car park is near the following address: [490 Old D
 undas Rd\, Hamilton\, ON L9G 3J2]()\n\nHistory\, hike\, and hills with Mo!
  What more can you ask for!\nJoin Mo on this great hike in Ancaster. Hamil
 ton has the best hikes!\nHighlights: Upper and Lower Mills Fall\, Canterbu
 ry Falls\, Sherman Falls\, Lower Little Falls\, Tiffany Falls\, Dundas Val
 ley Trail Centre\, The Hermitage\, Hermitage Cascade Falls.\nThus is a lon
 g day folks! So come prepared for a full day of good stuff! Make sure you 
 are well hydrated\, come with solid footwear\, and lots of snacks.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/these-boots-are-made-for-hiking/event
 s/315011597/
